Subject: [PATCH 07248/11362] [outer-loop] REQ-ARC-WMTE-5717: floor-aware +
 variance-aware A/B verdict for exp5717

The exact-grid-match reproduction accuracy floors at 0 for single-shot first-
contact induction on hard games, so the A/B now discriminates on the graded
per-changed-cell recall AND (1) reports metric_floored when even that is near
zero for both arms, and (2) refuses to call improved/hurt when the direction is
outlier-fragile under leave-one-out (the temperature>0 proposer yields per-run
recall from ~0 to ~0.7, so a single lucky induction must not decide the verdict).
Dedicated port + CUDA GPU 1 so the live A/B does not contend with other agents'
iGPU servers. Adds 8 unit tests for the pure aggregation/verdict logic.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
